{% set sd = summary['source'] %}
# Field Mappings from NetBox {{ netbox_version }} to Nautobot {{ nautobot_version }}

## Model Summary

This section lists all the models present in the NetBox source data that can be imported for this version pair, including a reason if a model is not imported. Additionally, some of the model fields might not have a Nautobot equivalent or are explicitly disabled, summarized below.

| Status | NetBox -> Nautobot Model | Imported Fields | Missing Fields | Disabled Fields | Comments |
| - | - | - | - | - | - |
{% for netbox_ct, ct_data in sd.items() %}
{% set f_disabled = ct_data['fields'].values() | selectattr('disable_reason') | list | length %}
{% set f_missing = ct_data['fields'].values() | selectattr('nautobot_internal_type','eq','NotFound') | list | length %}
{% set f_imported = ct_data['fields'] | length - f_missing - f_disabled %}
| {% if ct_data['disable_reason'] %}:x:{% else %}{{ ':white_check_mark:' if f_missing == 0 else ':warning:' }}{% endif %} | **{{ netbox_ct }}** -> **{{ ct_data['nautobot_content_type'] }}** | `{{ f_imported }}` | `{{ f_missing }}` | `{{ f_disabled }}` | {{ ct_data['disable_reason'] }} |
{% endfor %}

## Model Fields Mapping

This table lists all the model fields and how they have been mapped into their respective Nautobot models.

<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>NetBox -> Nautobot Model</th>
            <th>Field Names</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        {% for netbox_ct, ct_data in sd.items() if not ct_data['disable_reason'] %}
        <tr>
            <td><strong>{{ netbox_ct }} -> {{ ct_data['nautobot_content_type'] }}</strong></td>
            <td>
                <strong>Imported Fields:</strong>
                <ul>
                    {% for field in ct_data['fields'].values() if not field['disable_reason'] %}
                    <li>{{ field['name'] }} -> {{ field['nautobot_name'] }} ({{ field['nautobot_internal_type'] }})</li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ul>
                <strong>Disabled Fields:</strong>
                <ul>
                    {% for field in ct_data['fields'].values() if field['disable_reason'] %}
                    <li>{{ field['name'] }}: {{ field['disable_reason'] }}</li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ul>
            </td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
</table>
